    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds a Case Workflow Status" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Case Workflow Status</p>
            <p>Creates a new case workflow status with a generated mapping reference.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Settings → Case Workflow Statuses. 2. Click "Add". 3. Fill in the name and mapping reference. 4. Save the new workflow status. 5. Verify that a success message appears.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The case workflow status is successfully created.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
